line Hauls with the axis pinned
// Band labels stay inside the visible band and clear of points, lines,
// point values and series names (#2137). "Spills under" meets Brig's last point.
y-axis 0..100
marker y 140 Past the top
marker y -20 Below the floor
marker y 90 Inside red
band 80..160 Spills over the top
band -50..10 Spills under

series
  Sloop
  Brig

1 20 60
2 45 55
3 85 40
  note Sloop Peak
4 70 30
5 60 10
  note Brig Low point
